    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16437" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστάθμ-ητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unsteady, unstable,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστέρες,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλανῆται</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				4.7.5
			</span></i>; of persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ δῆμος -ότατον πρᾶγμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					19.136
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				169
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ly.</u>
				214d
			</span></i>; of life, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. αἰών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					981
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ. τοῦ μέλλοντος</span>
			<i>the uncertainty</i> of . . , <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.62
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς συμφορᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.59
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">&lt;&gt;ύχης -ότερον
				οὐδέν</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.85
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					4.122
				</span></i>
			.</div>
